{"speciesId":285,"names":{"fr":"Balignon","es":"Shroomish","en":"Shroomish","ja":"キノココ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SHROOMISH live in damp soil in the dark depths of forests. They are often found keeping still under fallen leaves. This POKéMON feeds on compost that is made up of fallen, rotted leaves."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"If SHROOMISH senses danger, it shakes its body and scatters spores from the top of its head. This POKéMON’s spores are so toxic, they make trees and weeds wilt."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It loves to eat damp, composted soil in forests. If you enter a forest after a long rain, you can see many SHROOMISH feasting on composted soil."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It prefers damp places. By day it remains still in the forest shade. It releases toxic powder from its head."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It prefers damp places. By day it remains still in the forest shade. It releases toxic powder from its head."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If it senses danger, it scatters spores from the top of its head to protect itself."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If it senses danger, it scatters spores from the top of its head to protect itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Le sommet de sa tête libère des spores empoisonnées. Il est dangereux de les inhaler."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le sommet de sa tête libère des spores empoisonnées. Il est dangereux de les inhaler."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il préfère les endroits humides. La journée, il reste à la lisière de la forêt. Il libère de la poudre toxique par sa tête."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Prefiere los sitios húmedos. De día está tranquilamente en el bosque, a la sombra. Expulsa polvo tóxico por la cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It prefers damp places. By day it remains still in the forest shade. It releases toxic powder from its head."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"湿った 場所を 好み 昼間は 森の 木陰で じっと している。 頭から 毒の 粉を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Le sommet de sa tête libère des spores empoisonnées. Il est dangereux de les inhaler."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Lanza esporas venenosas desde la parte superior de la cabeza. Inhalarlas es muy doloroso."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"頭の てっぺんから 毒胞子を 噴き出す。胞子を 吸いこむと 体の 節々が 痛くなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les Balignon vivent dans les sols humides et les recoins sombres des grandes forêts. On les trouve souvent immobiles sous les feuilles mortes. Ce Pokémon se nourrit d’un compost fait de feuilles mortes pourries."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Los Shroomish viven en zonas húmedas en la profunda oscuridad del bosque. Suelen quedarse tranquilamente bajo las hojas caídas. Se alimentan del abono que estas generan al empezar a pudrirse."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Shroomish live in damp soil in the dark depths of forests. They are often found keeping still under fallen leaves. This Pokémon feeds on compost that is made up of fallen, rotted leaves."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"深い 森の 湿った 地面に 生息。 落ち葉の 下で じっとしていることが 多い。 落ち葉が 積もって できた 腐葉土を 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque Balignon sent un danger, il secoue son corps et répand ses spores du haut de sa tête. Les spores de ce Pokémon sont si toxiques qu’elles font dépérir les arbres et les herbes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si Shroomish siente peligro, agita el cuerpo y libera esporas venenosas por la cabeza. Estas esporas son tan tóxicas que pueden hacer que se marchiten los árboles y hasta las malas hierbas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"If Shroomish senses danger, it shakes its body and scatters spores from the top of its head. This Pokémon’s spores are so toxic, they make trees and weeds wilt."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"危険を 感じると 体を 震わせて 頭の てっぺんから 胞子を ばらまくぞ。 草木も しおれてしまうほどの 猛毒だ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":285,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[5,"level-up",22],[6,"level-up",22],[7,"level-up",22],[8,"level-up",21],[9,"level-up",21],[10,"level-up",21],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",21],[12,"level-up",22],[13,"level-up",22],[14,"level-up",21],[15,"level-up",21],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[23,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",4],[6,"level-up",4],[7,"level-up",4],[8,"level-up",5],[9,"level-up",5],[10,"level-up",5],[11,